[{:adr/authoritative_for ["cloud-itonami-isic-4772 actor scope (online/retail pharmacy and OTC medical-goods storefront -- decides whether a dispense/refill is allowed and records it, never order-fulfillment/shipping/payment logistics)"
                          "PharmacyOrder-LLM ⊣ PharmacyGovernor の単一不変条件 (調剤・リフィル・開示・紛争解決は governor が拒否すれば actor は決して行わない)"
